# Kimi K2.8 Preview — findings by Kimi K3 (SELF-EXCLUDED: no verified public benchmarks)

- Source: Moonshot AI (`kimi-k2.8-preview`, alias `kimi-for-coding` in Kimi Code)
- Date: 2026-10-01 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card (verified specs — benchmark section below is empty by design)

- **Name:** Kimi K2.8 Preview
- **Short description:** Moonshot AI's mid-tier coding/agentic model, positioned between flagship Kimi K3 and Kimi K2.7 Code. Shipped 2026-09-11 as a silent swap behind the existing `kimi-for-coding` ID in Kimi Code. Vendor claim: overall performance "close to K3" with more efficient thinking — no public benchmark table published.
- **Provider / access:** Kimi Code membership API (`kimi-for-coding`; OpenAI-compatible `https://api.kimi.com/coding/v1`, Anthropic-compatible `https://api.kimi.com/coding/`); ZenMux gateway `moonshotai/kimi-k2.8-preview`. NOT on the Kimi Open Platform list (platform.kimi.com shows only kimi-k3, kimi-k2.7-code, kimi-k2.7-code-highspeed, kimi-k2.6) and no Hugging Face weights as of research date.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-09-11 (Kimi Code What's New); ZenMux publish time 2026-09-14. Knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** `moonshotai/kimi-k2.8-preview` (ZenMux); `kimi-for-coding` (Kimi Code alias). No standalone open-platform ID yet; no Zen Free ID verified.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens (1M), available to all Kimi Code membership tiers including free (Kimi Code docs via kimi-k2.org; ZenMux lists 1.05M).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, and video input; text output. Reasoning: three effort tiers low/high/max (default max), can be switched off. Tool calls and JSON mode supported via the coding product.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-01):** No official per-token price published (subscription membership, ¥0–699/month, quota-based). ZenMux gateway lists $1.00/M input, $4.00/M output, $0.25/M cache read (gateway rate, consistent with the unconfirmed Cindy Gateway table, $1/$4, reported by kie.ai). Measured gateway perf: TTFT ~1.69s, throughput ~30.3 tok/s (ZenMux live stats).
- **Architecture:** Not disclosed. Do not trust "2.8T" or "1T/32B" claims — those are K3 / K2.7 Code numbers (kimi-k2.org warning). Related to K3's KDA hybrid linear attention lineage per unofficial analysis (ai-all.info).

